EN:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}here's a bright idea, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I think.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If today's the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
and the sun isn't going down...
We should eat breakfast for lunch.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
And dinner. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Right, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}aklıma parlak bir fikir geldi,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
sanırım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Yaz Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
ise ve güneş batmıyorsa... Öğle yemeğinde
kahvaltı yapalım.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Akşam yemeğinde de.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Ne dersin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}¿Cómo llevas el día, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
No sé si te habrás dado cuenta,
pero ya es mediodía.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aunque claro, hoy no vas a notarlo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Las horas de sol se estiran {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}como
un chicle en el solsticio de verano.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, good afternoon, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}It's still afternoon, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}right? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I lose my
bearings on the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}It's all this extra summer in my head
today. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Everything feels like noon.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I know. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Crazy, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehi, buon pomeriggio, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}È ancora pomeriggio, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}giusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Con il solstizio perdo la bussola!
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Troppa estate, troppo sole oggi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
La mia testa non ce la fa.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Lo so. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Roba da matti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, iyi öğleden sonralar, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hâlâ öğleden sonra,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Yaz
Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'nde yönümü şaşırıyorum.{{TAG:0003:0028:}} Bugün
kafamın içi fazladan yazla dolu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Her şey
öğlen gibi geliyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Biliyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Çılgınca, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}liking this day-night stuff?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Yeah, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}everything runs together for
me during the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
I barely know what time it is.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Am {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}sleepy...? {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Or just waking up?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Not cool, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}solstice.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002A:}}Vi porgo i miei saluti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vi aggrada codesta maestosa luce
del solstizio d'estate, {{TAG:000E:0006:0E006D0065007300730065007200650016006D006100640061006D006900670065006C006C006100}}?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}OK, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}basta. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Mi sono iscritto a
un corso di galateo rinascimentale,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
e volevo fare un po' di esercizio...
